==English==
===Etymology===
From the Latin ''[[viridis]]'', from ''[[virere]]'' ‘to be green’.

===Noun===
'''viridian'''
# a bluish green pigment made from a form of [[chromic oxide]]
#(color) a bluish [[green]] color.
#: {{color panel|40826D}}

===Adjective===
'''viridian'''
#(colour) of a bluish [[green]] colour.

